> give s5g creativedelight:pear_tea
> give s5g creativedelight:lychee_juice
> give s5g creativedelight:hawberry_juice
> give s5g creativedelight:mango_juice
> give s5g creativedelight:mangosteen_juice
> give s5g creativedelight:peach_juice
count Gave 1 +\[ >= 14
> cdevtest tag fluid forge:fluid/kiwi_tea
> cdevtest tag fluid forge:fluid/turnip_tea
> cdevtest tag fluid forge:fluid/bayberry_tea
> cdevtest tag fluid forge:fluid/hamimelon_tea
> cdevtest tag fluid forge:fluid/carrot_tea
> cdevtest tag fluid forge:fluid/lemon_tea
> cdevtest tag fluid forge:fluid/melon_tea
