## CQ-DRK-03 | look: lemonade art and names; hand: the mixer and Kettle make them
@group client
@commands hotbar with the three drinks and Fruits Delight's lemon juice; tooltips; then by hand: unheated mixer 250 lemon juice + 250 water + sugar; the 500 mB lemonade + 2 blueberries, + 2 strawberries; Kettle on water with a lemon and sugar, on lemonade with a blueberry and with a strawberry, on water with two lemons
@pass LOOK: each drink is Fruits Delight's lemon juice glass with its tint in the liquid (plain pale yellow F3E99A, blue 8FB4E6, pink F2A7B8), names "Lemonade", "Blue Lemonade", "Pink Lemonade", effect lines on the tooltip; hand: 500 mB lemonade, then blue and pink; the Kettle gives lemonade, blue and pink, and two lemons still give lemon juice
@fails art `assets/creativedelight/textures/item/{lemonade,blue_lemonade,pink_lemonade}.png` (sources.csv row, R22); lang in the CD jar; recipes as SQ-DRK-09
@absent creativedelight:lemonade creativedelight:blue_lemonade creativedelight:pink_lemonade (registered 2026-11-21, after the last /dumpall)
> item replace entity @s hotbar.0 with creativedelight:lemonade
> item replace entity @s hotbar.1 with creativedelight:blue_lemonade
> item replace entity @s hotbar.2 with creativedelight:pink_lemonade
> item replace entity @s hotbar.3 with fruitsdelight:lemon_juice
do {"tooltip_text": "creativedelight:lemonade", "expect": "Lemonade"}
do {"tooltip_text": "creativedelight:blue_lemonade", "expect": "Blue Lemonade"}
do {"tooltip_text": "creativedelight:pink_lemonade", "expect": "Pink Lemonade"}
do {"slot": 0}
shot hotbar_lemonades
do {"tooltip": "creativedelight:blue_lemonade", "shift": true}
shot blue_lemonade_tooltip
bootreject Missing texture.*creativedelight:item/(blue_|pink_)?lemonade
look shots: three tinted lemon juice glasses beside the lemon juice; the mixer and Kettle runs stay hand checks (the runner notes each output)
